{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"a8cff07df4436a9539bf895e5d05a8aee3bb22d3a07e0d4012ef496d8c5e6ae0","ja":"さらに燃え上がるお芝居！","zh":"愈发火热的演出！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6714cfe6ce04d3cf4aae305bf458896b95bc09b9c0f67d104b038712874f4331","ja":"「絶対に許せない……！\nここから出て行って！」","zh":"“绝不能原谅……！\n从这里滚出去！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bd70f6aa251d4ad727c92cf1a15fcfd73849da969bcfe2e2769ad7c030ccfeb3","ja":"「はいそうですか、なんていくとでも思ってるのかい。\n私たちが邪魔なら、力づくでやってみな！」","zh":"「你以为事情会这么顺理成章地解决吗？\n要是嫌我们碍事，就凭实力来试试看啊！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7ed87eb52ecde4d821c1c71c6056cdac4eb70c761a464ba2459c9bb7a4095e73","ja":"「さあ、これで終わりだよっ！！」","zh":"“好了，到此为止了！！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"66e0c63e2850c401975ebc6102666ccbaf52058a9f629c32ec69173473df712b","ja":"バンッ！！！","zh":"砰！！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"cabba209d87b8d7b13e5fba092f2775ddbae093f55e89c501da5068eb1b3a4ab","ja":"ちょ、ちょっとあんたたち！　いったいどうしたのよ！\n怒鳴り声が廊下まで響いてたわよ！","zh":"等、等等你们几个！到底是怎么回事啊！\n大喊大叫的声音在走廊都听得到了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ac331b2667f28c034fba81dd6dbb2dca54ff2a1f24ea9259e31379287659076b","ja":"い、伊織ちゃん！？　大丈夫だよ！\n別にケンカしてたわけじゃないから……。","zh":"伊、伊织！？没事的啦！\n又不是在吵架……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"13994c748450f02022316e9c08cdad7600af51492cb00572105e5a58e6a442a6","ja":"そうそう、これはお芝居の練習だから。\n……っと、「隙あり～！！」","zh":"对对，这只是演戏的练习而已。\n……接招，“看招～！！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"e4b8db6afb492e2cf70af0136810c40decd88fb0af4f01895d6e2ca2a7c2e7eb","ja":"「この瞬間を待ってたぜ！\nてやあぁぁぁぁぁっ！」","zh":"「我就等这一瞬间呢！\n看招啊啊啊啊啊！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"d0b2644a9f70dd203bab7d5f367eadf7b4ce3d08ca27736a3692d28abf74213b","ja":"ちょっと！　人の話を聞きなさいよね！","zh":"喂！给我好好听别人说话啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"6685901daf85534cb5fb889c84f867a6e3603070c59c5dba862b3c8419c62419","ja":"まあまあ、みんな練習に白熱してるだけだから……。\nせっかくだから、伊織ちゃんもどう？　これ、台本ね♪","zh":"好了好了，大家只是练习得太投入了而已……\n难得有这个机会，小伊织也来试试怎么样？给，这是台本♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"24a506397026d11b9c850465f23d6111176a9ec785a2fca846dd77261eb78a0e","ja":"えっ、台本って……？","zh":"哎，台本是指……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"f560864c6b3ad6c66994ed1e7c542fe99e94ee80ee117033bb8885b4a9549400","ja":"わあ、助かる！　伊織ちゃんには\n謎の浪人役をやってほしいの！","zh":"哇，帮大忙了！我想让伊织\n来演神秘浪人的角色！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"c69f0cdd71fbd00f89455e8201374db22e95617b536363bca219c8a8a3b7ec79","ja":"そ、そんなまっすぐな目でお願いされても……。","zh":"就算你用那么真诚的眼神拜托我……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"233d0e831c8485ce47e420f82ebe18a1d4717e4131362374d1cec7c505f00654","ja":"お願い！　監督さんの期待に応えられるように、\nしっかり練習したくって……。","zh":"拜托了！为了不辜负导演的期望，\n我想好好练习……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"b0c5581462f2c542f4334678e3eca537cc1314c1a333b42b8206b3c62cf4ef52","ja":"はぁ……わかったわよ！\nこのページからでいいのね、それじゃあ……。","zh":"唉……我知道了啦！\n从这一页开始就可以了吧，那……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"111c9efff951fb9bc752eaa240062302a491170cfb2af745b25bb300b2d8291a","ja":"「お前さんたち！　3人がかりとは、\nちょいと見過ごせないねぇ！」","zh":"“你们这群家伙！3个人联手对付一个，\n我可不能坐视不管啊！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1298.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"c29500fb0bf032cca6c314bd9f1a778cd82276261ad42591ecdf2c24b78b10b9","ja":"「私が相手してあげるよ！\nてりゃぁぁぁぁぁーっ！！」","zh":"“我来做你的对手！\n看招啊啊啊啊啊——！！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
